{
	title: 'OpenCode Go: /login opencode',
	description: "OpenCode Go subscribers can use Hal (questions.md item 21). OpenCode Go is an OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions endpoint that authenticates with an API key (models.dev: opencode-go, https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1, env OPENCODE_API_KEY), so it is one more openai-compat endpoint, not new provider code. `/login opencode` (alias opencode-go) asks for the key through a secret form question and stores it in this home's credentials file; OPENCODE_API_KEY also works (task nd's rule: stored login first). Requests send User-Agent 'hal' and x-opencode-session with the session id, as the old Hal did (artifact old-openai.ts in task q7: compatHeaders). The model list comes from models.dev. Showing the subscription's usage (old Hal's opencode-usage.ts) is not part of this task.",
	status: 'planned',
	needs: ['nd', 'qq']
}
